{"sections":[{"slug":"严格1-范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"严格1-范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">严格</span> 1-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"严格 1-范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">严格</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴是由对象集</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">态射集以及态射的复合等等运算组成的结构</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">严格</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的全体构成一个</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}_1^{\\mathrm{st}}$, <span lang=\"zh\">而</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的全体构成的是一个</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}_1$. <span lang=\"zh\">因此两者不应当视为同一个概念</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">考虑两个对象</span> $x,y$ <span lang=\"zh\">组成的范畴</span>, $\\operatorname{Hom}(x,y) = \\operatorname{Hom}(y,x) = \\operatorname{Hom}(x,x) = \\operatorname{Hom}(y,y) = \\{*\\}$. <span lang=\"zh\">那么这个范畴在</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}_1$ <span lang=\"zh\">中等价于单点</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而在</span> $\\mathsf{Cat}_1^{\\mathrm{st}}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中不等价于单点</span>.</p>\n"}}}]}